[00:20.78]1. “Glory in the heights above”—
[00:29.32]Good news for all men—
[00:35.12]When God’s Son arrived in Bethlehem.
[00:45.88]Hope for those who mourn,
[00:51.81]A Savior has been born!
[00:57.57](Chorus)
[00:58.85]Good news, this good news—
[01:03.71]Joy for all mankind—
[01:10.19]Praise Jah for his light!
[01:19.79]Good news, this good news—
[01:26.77]Preach with all your might.
[01:33.47]Good news, Christ is born—
[01:39.51]The way, the truth, the life.
[02:01.23]2. He will reign for righteousness.
[02:07.33]Peace he will provide.
[02:13.61]Jesus is the way to endless life.
[02:24.47]Truth he will defend.
[02:29.55]His Kingdom will not end.
[02:36.59](Chorus)
[02:36.59]Good news, this good news—
[02:41.59]Joy for all mankind—
[02:48.47]Praise Jah for his light!
[03:00.03]Good news, this good news—
[03:04.85]Preach with all your might.
[03:11.25]Good news, Christ is born—
[03:17.73]The way, the truth, the life.
